GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.024(2) the appeal court shall also make an order for removal of the information from the database` MEANS
    IF `the appeal court makes an exemption order` THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the appeal court makes an exemption order" [marginal (a)]

@ref Criminal Code s 490.024(2) (src:10334-10335)
